## Checkpoint 03C.3 finalist ensembles

03C.3 uses only committed 03C.2 OOF predictions and does not refit models or inspect hidden targets.

Frozen individual finalists:

```text
F1 = C0_base + PLS
F2 = C3_base_agro_plus_discovery + Ridge
F3 = C1_agronomic + CatBoost
```

Fixed equal-weight ensembles:

```text
E12  = 0.5 F1 + 0.5 F2
E13  = 0.5 F1 + 0.5 F3
E23  = 0.5 F2 + 0.5 F3
E123 = (F1 + F2 + F3) / 3
```

Reviewed OOF evidence:

```text
E123: state 0.5121, municipality 0.7481
E13:  state 0.5082, municipality 0.7488
```

Retain both E13 and E123. Their municipality RMSE difference is below 0.001, so do not claim a meaningful winner and do not tune continuous ensemble weights.
